                } ],
                "dc.identifier.section_page_note" : [ {
                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>The Central Government may, by notification, appoint, as many persons as it may think fit to be surveyors for the purposes of this Act:<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>Provided that the Central Government may, by notification, authorise any person or body of persons, on such terms and conditions as may be specified therein, to be surveyor for the purposes of this Act.<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
